| 8 | **Vermelho** | `#ed1c24` | `#ffffff` | `#fee2e2` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.92)` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.5)` | `#1e293b` | `#475569` | `#ffffff` | `#ed1c24` | Flamengo |

